Package: rgph2024tn
Type: Package
Title: Tunisia 2024 General Census of Population and Housing
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Mohamed Dhia", "Hammami",
           email = "mdhiahammami@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides harmonized data from the 2024 Recensement General
    de la Population et de l'Habitat (RGPH) of Tunisia, conducted by the
    Institut National de la Statistique (INS). Delegation (279 units),
    gouvernorat (24), and national data are bundled; secteur-level data
    (5544 rows) is available via download. Covers 46 thematic indicators
    across education, employment, housing, infrastructure, health
    coverage, disability, household assets, and migration. Includes
    geographic coordinates, convenience accessors, Gini coefficients,
    and Theil index decomposition. Data source: INS open data portal
    <https://ins.tn>.
